      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Mineral oil is a colorless, transparent, oily liquid derived from crude petroleum oil. It is utilized for various purposes including treating dry skin, constipation, eczema, cradle cap, and facilitating bowel movements. Mineral oil is also a by-product from the refining of crude oil and the manufacturing of gasoline and petroleum products. It is odorless and used in cosmetics, science labs, industrial settings, and more. Despite its industrial origins, it has applications in the kitchen and is a refined petroleum oil used as a laxative.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "矿物油是一种由原油衍生而来的无色透明油状液体。它用于各种目的，包括治疗皮肤干燥、便秘、湿疹、乳痂和促进排便。矿物油也是原油精炼以及汽油和石油产品制造的副产品。它无味，用于化妆品、科学实验室、工业环境等。尽管它起源于工业，但它在厨房中也有应用，是一种用作泻药的精炼石油。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
